<header class="wrap hero" id="start">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="pill">VIP travel concierge</span>
      <h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:18px">Your concierge for the city you just landed&nbsp;in.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Message Num once. It plans the day, books the table and keeps the whole trip in one thread &mdash; in your language, at any hour.</p>
      <div class="trust">
        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>77 destinations, 38 countries</span>
        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Every place verified</span>
        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>16 languages</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="getcard">
      <h2>Get your concierge</h2>
      <p class="gsub">Add your email and the install link appears right here.</p>

      <div id="su-form">
        <form data-num-capture data-source="vip-landing" data-done="You are in.">
          <input class="fld" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email address" required>
          <input class="fld" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="First name (optional)">
          <input class="fld" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Mobile number (optional)">
          <p class="fhint">Add your mobile and Num will message you the moment WhatsApp opens in your country.</p>

          <label class="optin">
            <input type="checkbox" name="marketing_ok" value="1">
            <span>Email me travel notes from Num and tell me when it opens in a new country. I can stop any time.</span>
          </label>

          <button class="btn pri lg" type="submit">Get my link</button>
          <p class="msg" data-num-msg></p>
        </form>

        <div class="orsep">or start now</div>
        <a class="btn ghost lg" href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@799pyrus">Message Num on LINE</a>
      </div>

      <div id="su-done" hidden>
        <div class="doneic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3 class="doneh">You are in. Here is your link.</h3>
        <p class="gsub">Open it on the phone you travel with, or scan the code.</p>
        <a class="btn pri lg" href="/get/">Get the app</a>
        <div class="qrwhite"><img src="/app/qr-get.png" alt="QR code to install Num" width="120" height="120"></div>
        <div class="orsep">or message it now</div>
        <a class="btn ghost lg" href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@799pyrus">Message Num on LINE</a>
      </div>

      <p class="fine">We use your details to hand you the app link and to answer you. Nothing else. <span style="white-space:nowrap"><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms/">Terms</a></span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- REAL PEOPLE, REAL PLACES -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="sechead" style="max-width:620px">
    <span class="kicker">Real travellers</span>
    <h2 class="h2">The trips it is already running.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Beach towns, capitals and the islands in between. Seventy-seven destinations, thirty-eight countries, one thread.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="people">
    <img src="/assets/p1.jpg" alt="Two travellers laughing over a phone on a beach town street">
    <img src="/assets/p2.jpg" alt="A traveller planning the evening from the sand">
    <img src="/assets/p3.jpg" alt="Friends looking out over the rice terraces while they plan the day">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT PEOPLE ASK IT -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="sechead">
    <span class="kicker">What people actually ask it</span>
    <h2 class="h2">Say it the way you would say it to a person.</h2>
    <p class="lead">No menus, no filters, no ten tabs open at midnight. One message.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="asks">
    <div class="ask">
      <span class="qq">Just landed in Phuket. Dinner tonight, somewhere quiet.</span>
      <p class="ans">Three within ten minutes of you, all open now and all verified this month. Want me to hold 8pm at the first one?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ask">
      <span class="qq">Book the same place as last time, table for four.</span>
      <p class="ans">Done. Friday 7.30pm, confirmed under your name, and it is on your calendar. Your driver knows the address.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ask">
      <span class="qq">Anything worth doing before my flight tomorrow?</span>
      <p class="ans">Two, both on the airport road. I checked their opening hours against your 2pm departure so you are not cutting it fine.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="sechead">
    <span class="kicker">How it works</span>
    <h2 class="h2">Three steps, then it runs the trip.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="vsteps">
    <div class="vstep">
      <div class="vnum">1</div>
      <h3>Tell it where you are</h3>
      <p>Type the city, or let it read your location. It switches to the place you are standing in, not the place you booked from.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="vstep">
      <div class="vnum">2</div>
      <h3>Ask for anything</h3>
      <p>Dinner, a driver, a last-minute table, a pharmacy that is still open. It answers from verified places, not scraped listings.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="vstep">
      <div class="vnum">3</div>
      <h3>It handles the rest</h3>
      <p>Booking, confirmation, calendar, the address in the local language for the driver. You get one thread, start to finish.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INSIDE THE APP -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="sechead">
    <span class="kicker">Inside the app</span>
    <h2 class="h2">Built for the way a trip actually goes.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:28px">
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-9 8.4 8.9 8.9 0 0 1-4-.9L3 21l1.9-4.9A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 4 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 8.5-8.4A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 21 11.5Z"/></svg></div>
      <h3>One thread for the whole trip</h3>
      <p>Flights, dinners, drivers and plans in a single conversation you can scroll back through.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 4 6.5v5c0 4.6 3.2 8.6 8 9.5 4.8-.9 8-4.9 8-9.5v-5Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Real places, verified</h3>
      <p>Every recommendation comes from a checked record with real hours, not a listing nobody has looked at in two years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M3 10h18"/><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Bookings without the back and forth</h3>
      <p>It contacts the place, confirms the time and puts it in your calendar. You approve, it does the chasing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 20v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9.5" cy="7" r="3.5"/><path d="M22 20v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16.5 3.6a4 4 0 0 1 0 6.8"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Plans you build with friends</h3>
      <p>Share a plan, everyone adds to it, Num keeps one version. Invite anyone by text &mdash; no account needed to see it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5c0 1.6-.6 2.7-1.4 3.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 4 14.6 4.4 4.4 0 0 0 8.4 19H12"/><path d="M12 3a5 5 0 0 1 5 5c0 1.6.6 2.7 1.4 3.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 1 20 14.6 4.4 4.4 0 0 1 15.6 19H12"/><path d="M12 3v18"/></svg></div>
      <h3>It remembers what you like</h3>
      <p>Window table, no coriander, always a driver after 10pm. Say it once and it holds for every trip after.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card hov">
      <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18 15 15 0 0 1 0-18Z"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Any language, any hour</h3>
      <p>Ask in yours, it speaks to the restaurant in theirs. Sixteen languages, and it does not sleep when you land at 3am.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--slate)">There are twelve more. <a href="/app/" style="color:var(--pri-d);font-weight:700">See everything the app does</a></p>
</section>

<!-- CLOSE -->
<section class="wrap">
  <div class="vband">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h2">Land somewhere new. Have someone there already.</h2>
      <p>Free to start. Works on every phone. Scan the code or send yourself the link.</p>
      <div class="bandbtns">
        <a class="btn pri lg" href="/get/">Get the app</a>
        <a class="btn light lg" href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@799pyrus">Message Num on LINE</a>
        <button class="btn light lg" type="button" data-share>Share the link</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="qrbox"><img src="/app/qr-get.png" alt="QR code to install Num" width="136" height="136"></div>
      <div class="qrcap">Point your camera here</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

